<annotation ref="figure" text="The rectangle S, shaded orange, with corners at the origin and 3 comma 2 in the u v plane. Its area is 6 times the area of the unit square R.">
  <annotation ref="rs-rect" text="The rectangle S from 0 to 3 in u and 0 to 2 in v. The transformation shrinks it onto the unit square."/>
</annotation>
